sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Customer->>Product: View current order state
    alt Received or Preparing
    Product-->>Customer: Not ready for collection
    else Ready
    Product-->>Customer: Ready, order number, pickup location/instructions and pay-at-collection
    else Cancelled
    Product-->>Customer: Cancellation reason and labeled restaurant contact
    else Collected
    Product-->>Customer: Collected confirmation, no further pickup action
    end
    Note over Customer,Product: If information is stale, retain the warning alongside these messages.
